+### Evidencia preventiva adicional del lote 00 (2026-10-02)
+
+**`FORUM-00-AUTOTUNER-PROGRESS-CPU-ADMISSION`** — [373320](https://forums.developer.nvidia.com/t/can-someone-please-just-help-me-set-the-dgx-spark-up-for-optimal-llm-use/373320) reports AutoTuner around 96% for ~30 minutes while CPU/GPU load prevented the owner from checking progress/access. No telemetry or solution is supplied. Test progress/CPU/GPU/UMA and SSH during bounded tuning; distinguish slow valid work from a stalled host before canceling.
